		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=18357#p18357"><![CDATA[
The precompiled Mac plugin is probably generated using OSX Snow Leopard / 10.6.<br><br>Easiest is to just compile the Maya plugin yourself.  Download and unzip the Bullet sources, and go to Bullet/Extras/MayaPlugin and in a terminal window run<br><div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>make -f Makefile.mac</code></pre></div>Thanks,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sun Apr 25, 2010 12:25 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
